! mcp_bootstrap_p276.strap -- MCP printed page 276: RESERVATIONS,
! TABLES AND COUNTERS of the body's DECODE (L LPPURF .. L INFAD), lines 1-52.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_250-445.pdf PDF p.27, read at 400 dpi, doubtful glyphs
! at 900 dpi.  Header, READ: "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID 11D11MCP  CARD
! ID QD000026  DIST. OF 3/01  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 276" (round glyphs in
! numeric fields read 0).  The heading row's LOCATION field is BLANK:
! line 1 is PRNS and compiles nothing.
!
! THE SAME SOURCE AS printed p.48 (IPL assembly, decks/mcp_bootstrap_p48
! .strap), card for card, assembled here in the body at 231523.00.
! Its stand-in values differ from p.48's (a different assembly).
!
! THE PAGE.  52 lines; every line number prints a "*" after it.
!   line 1      PRNS (listing control, emits nothing).
!   lines 2-4, 6-8, 19-21, 30-32, 41-43  remark/banner cards.
!   line 5      L IREF SYN(BU,12),0.52 prints 000000.64+, dds "BU,14 ,10".
!   lines 9-18  ten XWs, 231523.00 .. 231534.00.
!   lines 22-29 eight XWs, 231535.00 .. 231544.00 ("*" after line 22's
!               location).
!   lines 33-40 L IODX .. L WORKX SYN,$3..$10, print 000023.00+ .. 000032.00+,
!               dds "BU,100,10".
!   lines 44-52 the bit chain 231545.00 .. 231545.73 (VF = 25 bits, so
!               line 45 is at .31; "*" after line 45's location).  DRZ rows
!               print their size (000000.07, 000000.11) and get no !CHECK;
!               line 51's (AX)DD prints no binary and gets no !CHECK; the
!               DD(BU,1) rows print their one bit at the right of the field.
! Located rows run contiguous from 231523.00 to 231545.73 (+1 bit).
!
! JOIN.  printed p.275 (QD000001..QD000024, not landed) is comment cards
! after "SLC,$" at 231522.40, so this page's first XW at 231523.00 is
! that counter rounded to a word: contiguous.  printed p.277's sheet
! opens at 231546.00 (L SAVE XW), the next word after 231545.74:
! contiguous.  p.277 line 7 "LASTPP XW,TPREFT" at 231553.00 is the
! value p.265's LASTPP stand-in carries -- a cross-witness.
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * line 50 "L CVBIT" = LOVBIT (open O): p.48 line 50 / p.52 (landed,
!     IPL assembly) spell L OVBIT; comment "-OVERLAPPED JOB BIT".
!   * line 51 "L BLZCR" = LBLZOR (open O): landed p.48/p.54/p.98 spell
!     LBLZOR; nothing on this page closes the glyph.  Unreferenced here.
!   * line 13 "LICTBX" (and line 24's operand) = LIOTBX; line 24
!     "TICREC" = TIOREQ; line 33 "IODX" = LIODX: as landed p.48, and
!     the binaries (232307.00, 231527) agree.
!   * line 48 prints its bit as "C" = 0 (DD(BU,1),0); lines 50, 52 print 0.
!   * octal fields "CCCCCC.CC", "CCC" are 0.
!   * the XW counts are read off the count field (octal): line 12/23
!     000025 = 21 (p.48's IPL assembly prints 20 -- a different TPPC),
!     line 13/24 000120 = 80, lines 14/25 000062 = 50, lines 10-11
!     000024 = 20, line 9 000002 = 2.
!
! EXTERNALS.  None of the T*/L* table symbols is landed in the body;
! every value below is this page's binary (XW value field: full word,
! BIT-EXACT to the word; count field: the integer).
!
! CARD SERIALS.  QD000026 .. QD000077, line N prints QD0000(25+N).
! p.275 ends at QD000024: QD000025 is printed on neither page.

TPURFT  SYN, (8)021106.0             ! not landed; XW value line 9 021106.00
TUPPC   SYN, 2                       ! not landed; XW count line 9 000002
